  cites Math chapter Matrix4
  cites Math chapter Cordic
  cites Game chapter Color

 The four meshes codex/test/engine-mesh-gen builds, a sphere, a cylinder, a
 cone and a torus, standing in a row on a plane and rendered by Renderer3D
 with Gouraud shading into the screen that UEFI's GOP protocol describes. The
 camera circles them by the clock the framebuffer platform writes before each
 frame, one milliradian a millisecond.

 We say:

Section: Screen

  fb-base : Integer = 3204448256
  cell-width : Integer = 1988
  cell-height : Integer = 1992
  cell-stride : Integer = 2016
  cell-clock : Integer = 2032

  sky : Integer = #101828

Section: Scene

 Each mesh is engine-mesh-gen's, lifted so it stands on the plane: the sphere
 by its radius, the cylinder by its half height, the torus by its thickness.

  shaded : Rgb -> EngineMaterial
  shaded (c) = emat-set-shading (emat-shiny c 24) GouraudShaded

  scene-at : Integer -> Scene3DState
  scene-at (angle) =
    let ex = real-from-int (7000 * cordic-sin angle / 1000)
    in let ez = real-from-int (7000 * cordic-cos angle / 1000)
    in let cam = camera3d-new (vec3-new ex 2400.0 ez) (vec3-new 0.0 400.0 0.0) 0.785
    in let stage = scene3d-new cam
    in let ground = sn3-with-mesh "ground" (mesh-plane 6000 6000) (emat-flat (rgb 70 70 80))
    in let sphere = sn3-set-pos (sn3-with-mesh "sphere" (mesh-sphere 800 8 6) (shaded (rgb 200 160 90))) (-2700.0) 800.0 0.0
    in let cylinder = sn3-set-pos (sn3-with-mesh "cylinder" (mesh-cylinder 500 400 8) (shaded (rgb 90 170 220))) (-900.0) 400.0 0.0
    in let cone = sn3-set-pos (sn3-with-mesh "cone" (mesh-cone 500 900 8) (shaded (rgb 220 90 90))) 900.0 0.0 0.0
    in let torus = sn3-set-pos (sn3-with-mesh "torus" (mesh-torus 700 200 8 6) (shaded (rgb 120 210 120))) 2700.0 200.0 0.0
    in let s2 = scene3d-add (scene3d-add (scene3d-add (scene3d-add (scene3d-add stage ground) sphere) cylinder) cone) torus
    in let key = dir-light (vec3-new (-400.0) 800.0 600.0) (rgb 255 250 235) 850
    in scene3d-set-ambient (scene3d-add-light s2 key) 250

Section: Entry

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    let w = peek-32 cell-width 0
    in let h = peek-32 cell-height 0
    in let stride = peek-32 cell-stride 0
    in let angle = peek-32 cell-clock 0
    in let tgt = r3d-target-at fb-base stride w h sky
    in let d = r3d-render-into tgt (scene-at angle)
    in act
      print-line-uni ("camera : " & show angle & " milliradians round the meshes")
    end
  end
